=Generate sentence number {{ $json.sentenceIndex }} (out of {{ $json.totalCount }} total).

Provide this sentence in the following languages: {{ $json.languages.join(', ') }}.

Return ONLY a raw JSON object — no markdown, no backticks, no explanation:
{
  "sentenceIndex": {{ $json.sentenceIndex }},
  "translations": {
    "{{ $json.languages[0] }}": "<sentence in {{ $json.languages[0] }}>"
  }
}

Include ALL requested languages as separate keys inside "translations".
Make the sentence natural, varied, and interesting.

